commit 61e3e7664a3e55f00274eded832bbea7d192081d
Author: Kanban Agent <agent@kanban.local>
Date:   Sat Nov 21 14:52:07 2026 -0500

    feat(importer,export,aliases): multi-source Jira, GitHub, Linear imports, legacy aliases, and portable workspace exporter (KAN-77)
    
    - Scaffold migration p6_03_multi_source_imports_and_aliases chained on p6_02_pdf_attachments:
      - Widen import_entity_mappings_source_system_check to ('plane', 'jira', 'github', 'linear').
      - Create issue_key_aliases with composite PK (workspace_id, legacy_key), regex validation, index on (workspace_id, issue_id), and FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY.
    - Implement legacy key resolution in ResolutionService, GET /api/v1/resolve, GET /api/v1/issues/{identifier}, and mcp/resolver.py:
      - Return canonical object with X-Kanban-Canonical-Key header and 308 redirect for HTML navigation.
    - Implement JiraImporter (ADF/HTML markdown normalization, parent/issuelink DAG, comments, user mapping), GitHubIssuesImporter, and LinearImporter (JSON/CSV, DAG parentId/relations).
    - Expose import endpoints at /api/v1/admin/imports/{jira,github,linear} protected by Depends(require_admin_aal2) and kanban-ctl import CLI commands.
    - Implement PortableWorkspaceExporter producing deterministic .tar.gz archives (mtime=0, uid=0, gid=0, sorted (object_kind, id), manifest.json SHA-256 digests, entities/*.jsonl, markdown/issues/<KEY>.md, markdown/docs/<PATH>.md, attachments/sha256/<digest>, optional scrub_text secret scrubbing).
    - Expose portable export endpoint at /api/v1/admin/exports/portable (Depends(require_admin_aal2)) and kanban-ctl export portable CLI.
    - Provide comprehensive test coverage (>=95% on touched files) and frontend Admin Import Studio source selector integration.

